    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>3级 护卫</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 47；''重伤'' 23</span><span>''先攻'' +5</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 20，''强韧'' 15，''反射'' 14，''意志'' 13</span><span>''侦查'' +2</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6（沼泽行者）</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">毒素打击</div>\n<div class=description>毒鳞仆从对任何承受着持续毒素伤害的生物的伤害骰获得+2 加值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}木棒（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+10 vs. AC<br>命中：1d10+3 伤害，且目标被标记直到该毒鳞仆从下回合结束。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（从左往右：毒鳞仆从，毒鳞狂怒者，毒鳞法师）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+9</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 17（+4）</span><span>''敏捷'' 15（+3）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 10（+1）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+0）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 龙语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 木棒，龟甲盾（轻盾）</span></div></div>\n</div>",
